# The commit of this repository whose wallet companion (crates/zkapi-companion,
# binary zkapi-walletd) and protocol crates release builds compile and test.
# prepare-zkapi.sh checks this commit out; verify-zkapi-source.py requires
# exactly it, with a clean tree. Move it to a commit that contains every
# companion, protocol and Cargo.lock change a release must ship.
#
# A release must pin a commit that is pushed to the public repository
# (https://github.com/ethereum/zkapi, or ZKAPI_SOURCE_REPOSITORY): the release
# workflow's shallow checkout fetches the pinned commit from there, and anyone
# rebuilding or reviewing a release must be able to fetch exactly it. A local
# commit that was never pushed (for example on concession/integration before
# it merges) serves development and CI from this checkout only; push it, or
# move the pin to its pushed equivalent, before assembling a release.
ZKAPI_SOURCE_COMMIT=544630c604024619ebee08871f8c9356b97630d0
